## Your output

Produce a JSON brief with this shape. Be specific — name agents in your
consensus and disagreement points; quote concrete numbers where you can.

```
{
  "recommendation": "APPROVE" | "APPROVE_WITH_CONDITIONS" | "REJECT" | "ESCALATE",
  "confidence": "HIGH" | "MEDIUM" | "LOW",
